---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Interests — Junaid Bhatti">
  <div class="page">
    <div class="back-row">
      <a href="/other" class="back-link">&larr; back</a>
    </div>

    <div class="interests-content">
      <div class="interests-lead">Talk to me about any of these.</div>

      <div class="interests-grid">
        <div class="interests-col">
          <div class="interests-col-label">Numbers</div>
          <div class="interests-items">
            <div>Mathematics — proofs over computation</div>
            <div>Chess — openings, endgames, the long middle</div>
            <div>Probability and how badly people reason about it</div>
            <div>Markets, valuation, and what a business is worth</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="interests-col">
          <div class="interests-col-label">Words</div>
          <div class="interests-items">
            <div>American literature, Melville above all</div>
            <div>Philosophy of mind and what machines can't do</div>
            <div>Ethics — the applied kind, not the seminar kind</div>
            <div><a href="/writing" class="inline-link">Writing</a> as a way of finding out what I think</div>
            <div>Urdu, and learning a language late</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="interests-col">
          <div class="interests-col-label">Everything else</div>
          <div class="interests-items">
            <div>Food — restaurants, ranking them, arguing about them</div>
            <div>Los Angeles vs. New York, endlessly</div>
            <div>Football, and the psychology of a close game</div>
            <div>Building small things that only I use</div>
            <div>Religion, practice, and doubt</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
